  m_text: '- <b>Start</b> (Menu page) is a <b>BtnChangePage</b>: GameState Start
    runs GM.StartGame, then PageGame opens.

    - <b>Pause popup</b> = PM.ChangePageByName("PagePause"),
    <b>Back</b> = SwitchToPreviousPage, <b>Close</b> = CloseCurrentPage.

    - <b>GM
    Win</b> calls GM.Win(); PM (Integrate With GM) opens PageWin. GM wins only in
    the Game state: press Start first.

    - Edit Mode: select <b>PM</b> and use
    Editor Preview to show any page. Code: PM.I.ChangePage(pageId), UIKit.ShowPage("PagePause").'
